#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:5
#: 4370bbbb12e6400abafe21c75956e9f5
msgid "Non-GPS Position Estimation"
msgstr "无 GPS 位置估计"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:7
#: e97e8608f1c24dd28015a0234381ee2e
msgid ""
"This page explains how MAVLink can be used to send in external position and "
"velocity estimates to ArduPilot's EKF allowing it to maintain a position "
"estimate and thus control itself without a GPS"
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何使用 MAVLink 向 ArduPilot 的 EKF 发送外部位置和速度估计值，使其能够在没有 GPS "
"的情况下维持位置估计并实现自主控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:9
#: 5b190c9dd8824d5a965e9f2af2496569
msgid ""
"This is also called \"External Navigation\" although to be more precise it "
"involves estimation rather than navigation or control."
msgstr "这也被称为 「外部导航」，尽管更准确地说，它涉及的是估计而非导航或控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:13
#: fdfdbbd6f61049f4b2bd4cb7b5044dc6
msgid ""
"The user wiki pages for :ref:`Non-GPS navigation is here <copter:common-non-"
"gps-navigation-landing-page>` and :ref:`GPS/Non-GPS transitions is here "
"<copter:common-non-gps-to-gps>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`无 GPS 导航 <copter:common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page>` 及 "
":ref:`GPS/无 GPS 切换 <copter:common-non-gps-to-gps>` 的用户 wiki 页面请见上述链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:15
#: 5add0453e8a341a585c7e3dcf77d3137
msgid ""
"Any of the following messages should be sent to the autopilot at 4hz or "
"higher:"
msgstr "以下任意消息均应以 4Hz 或更高频率发送至飞控："

