#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:25
#: 4a52428583454ca898d5dfb56904448c
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's parameters should be setup as if a :ref:`ModalAI VOXL "
"<copter:common-modalai-voxl>` is used which includes:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 的参数应按照使用 :ref:`ModalAI VOXL <copter:common-modalai-voxl>` "
"的方式进行配置，具体包括："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:27
#: d070fae2d4f142a5b60843bee48e80f2
msgid "Set :ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` = 3 (VOXL)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` 设置为 3（VOXL）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:28
#: 8b2371b79b6a4168ab7351494e643327
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`VISO_POS_X <VISO_POS_X>`, :ref:`VISO_POS_Y <VISO_POS_Y>`, "
":ref:`VISO_POS_Z <VISO_POS_Z>` to the camera's position on the vehicle"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`VISO_POS_X <VISO_POS_X>`、:ref:`VISO_POS_Y "
"<VISO_POS_Y>`、:ref:`VISO_POS_Z <VISO_POS_Z>` 设置为相机在飞行器上的安装位置"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:29
#: 696857c142934b7c95686fdc8ba9bcf5
msgid "Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 6 (ExternalNav)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` 设置为 6（ExternalNav）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:30
#: ec064939b22840fd8c62a6234709cd54
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 6 (ExternalNav) or 0 (None)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` 设置为 6（ExternalNav）或 0（None）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:31
#: 1311f853708149959db8174cc46a24b7
msgid "Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` = 6 (ExternalNav) or 1 (Baro)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` 设置为 6（ExternalNav）或 1（Baro）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:32
#: 8dd514131b8a488e801a42136610e30e
msgid "Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` = 6 (ExternalNav) or 0 (None)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` 设置为 6（ExternalNav）或 0（None）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:33
#: a3e5b0e9fb164775a24b6daa4d77aa3c
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 6 (ExternalNav) or 1 (Compass)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` 设置为 6（ExternalNav）或 1（Compass）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:35
#: 78548376e7fc4f79a82c6aa6c22e4b74
msgid ""
"In addition it may be useful to setup :ref:`GPS/Non-GPS transitions "
"<copter:common-non-gps-to-gps>` to allow switching between GPS and External "
"Navigation"
msgstr ""
"此外，配置 :ref:`GPS/无 GPS 切换 <copter:common-non-gps-to-gps>` 以允许在 GPS "
"和外部导航之间切换，可能也会很有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:37
#: 47129ee0a3e74a97bbfca7ac65414174
msgid ""
"If no GPS is attached to the autopilot then the :ref:`EKF origin must be set"
" <mavlink-get-set-home-and-origin>` before the EKF can start estimating its "
"position.  If the vehicle will always be flown at the same location the "
"`ahrs-set-origin.lua script "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/ahrs-"
"set-origin.lua>`__ may be used"
msgstr ""
"若飞控未连接 GPS，则在 EKF 开始估计位置之前必须 :ref:`设置 EKF 原点 <mavlink-get-set-home-and-"
"origin>`。若飞行器始终在同一地点飞行，可以使用 `ahrs-set-origin.lua 脚本 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/ahrs-"
"set-origin.lua>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:40
#: 3c0aa3255b9640868bae7a1c3eec45eb
msgid "ODOMETRY message"
msgstr "ODOMETRY 消息"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:42
#: 943a3bd0ad1147de8d89d60c84259148
msgid ""
"The preferred method is to send an `ODOMETRY "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ODOMETRY>`__ with the fields "
"populated as described below:"
msgstr ""
"推荐的方式是发送 `ODOMETRY <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ODOMETRY>`__ "
"消息，并按如下说明填写各字段："

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:149
#: d41f47f9ba1d465294ced88874733112
msgid ""
"Six \"pos_covariance\" array elements are used to calculate the position "
"error and angle error"
msgstr "六个 「pos_covariance」 数组元素用于计算位置误差和角度误差"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:151
#: cf020e90c22c4863817928e2247a5228
msgid "0: x-axis position error (m)"
msgstr "0：x 轴位置误差（米）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:152
#: cda5b1e89c7848b3ab4690d442d46804
msgid "6: y-axis position error (m)"
msgstr "6：y 轴位置误差（米）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:153
#: 725dbe112653446982c25ded2bda8f30
msgid "11: z-axis position error (m)"
msgstr "11：z 轴位置误差（米）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:154
#: b26f6d56237c4109a8746ecc8d34c025
msgid "15: roll angle error (rad)"
msgstr "15：横滚角误差（弧度）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:155
#: 786e8973ce074ed5bfd295cb70fde4a7
msgid "18: pitch angle error (rad)"
msgstr "18：俯仰角误差（弧度）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:156
#: e8f5220bb06c4f7988a3e7de0197cc56
msgid "20: yaw angle error (rad)"
msgstr "20：偏航角误差（弧度）"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:158
#: d58efa4542a545239b68192c15ebc002
msgid ""
"For both position and angle error, the 3 elements are combined to create a "
"single error which is used during EKF sensor fusion"
msgstr "对于位置误差和角度误差，3 个元素合并为单个误差值，用于 EKF 传感器融合。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:163
#: 6bbe5fd8b8204c4aaad606db39dfeeec
msgid ""
"In addition the position error is constrained to be between "
":ref:`VISO_POS_M_NSE <VISO_POS_M_NSE>` and 100 and the angle error between "
":ref:`VISO_YAW_M_NSE <VISO_YAW_M_NSE>` and 1.5"
msgstr ""
"此外，位置误差被约束在 :ref:`VISO_POS_M_NSE <VISO_POS_M_NSE>` 与 100 之间，角度误差被约束在 "
":ref:`VISO_YAW_M_NSE <VISO_YAW_M_NSE>` 与 1.5 之间。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:165
#: f362ed7b1ae24ccca956b6e0bb78ca8a
msgid ""
"Messages with \"quality\" below the :ref:`VISO_QUAL_MIN <VISO_QUAL_MIN>` "
"parameter value are ignored"
msgstr "「quality」 低于 :ref:`VISO_QUAL_MIN <VISO_QUAL_MIN>` 参数值的消息将被忽略。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:168
#: ca0d55c737b04915a63338db3a4b7246
msgid "OPTICAL_FLOW message"
msgstr "OPTICAL_FLOW 消息"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:170
#: b4f1b095f40f4fd29614ad66b34d372d
msgid ""
"An offboard optical flow sensor can send its horizontal flow sensor data to "
"the autopilot using the `OPTICAL_FLOW "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#OPTICAL_FLOW>`__ message"
msgstr ""
"外部光流传感器可使用 `OPTICAL_FLOW "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#OPTICAL_FLOW>`__ "
"消息将其水平流传感器数据发送至飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:172
#: 5de82b9dd2934177a74fd533bfa45d36
msgid ""
"Users should set :ref:`FLOW_TYPE<FLOW_TYPE>` = 5 (MAVLink) and then perform "
"the :ref:`Optical Flow Setup procedure <copter:common-optical-flow-sensor-"
"setup>` before use"
msgstr ""
"用户应将 :ref:`FLOW_TYPE<FLOW_TYPE>` 设置为 5（MAVLink），然后在使用前执行 :ref:`光流设置流程 "
"<copter:common-optical-flow-sensor-setup>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:236
#: 2e87109c6d7748d6b4fc176adc1c5cd8
msgid ""
"Please see this `issue 29131 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/29131>`__ for improvements we"
" should make to the handling of this message"
msgstr ""
"请参阅 `issue 29131 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/29131>`__ "
"了解我们应对该消息处理进行的改进。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:239
#: 775858c47c814e23b30f4e83284880b4
msgid "GPS/Non-GPS Transitions"
msgstr "GPS/无 GPS 切换"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:241
#: ddd12d41fa5a48068b6ae7e2525a3c1d
msgid ""
"The user wiki page for :ref:`GPS/Non-GPS transitions is here <copter:common-"
"non-gps-to-gps>`"
msgstr ":ref:`GPS/无 GPS 切换 <copter:common-non-gps-to-gps>` 的用户 wiki 页面请见此处。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:243
#: 7f01e183dc0d4a63960f2630b9584c18
msgid ""
"The EKF's active source set can be changed in real-time by sending a "
"`COMMAND_LONG <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ "
"or `COMMAND_INT <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ "
"message with the \"command\" field set to `MAV_CMD_SET_EKF_SOURCE_SET "
"(42007) "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/ardupilotmega.xml#L144>`__"
" and \"param1\" set to a number between 1 and 3"
msgstr ""
"可通过发送 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ 或 `COMMAND_INT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ 消息，将 「command」 "
"字段设置为 `MAV_CMD_SET_EKF_SOURCE_SET (42007) "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/ardupilotmega.xml#L144>`__，「param1」"
" 设置为 1 到 3 之间的数字，从而实时更改 EKF 的活动源集。"
